+        // below) expanded every non-ASCII byte again -- 鐜?(E7 8E B0) arrived as U+00E7
+        // U+008E U+00B0, i.e. "莽" + control + "掳" -- and the application stored, logged
+        // and sent on that mojibake. Such a batch already IS the original UTF-8 stream,
